action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P8 steps 5 and 6: scroll the strip sideways to its right-hand end, keep going,
# then scroll vertically.
#
# Step 5 passes if the strip's contents move. Step 6 passes if the outer view
# still responds afterwards -- the failure it guards against is everything
# freezing once the inner view has nowhere left to go, so the vertical scroll at
# the end is the check, not an extra.
#
# P8 步驟 5 與 6：將長條向右捲到底、繼續捲，然後改為垂直捲動。
#
# 步驟 5 通過的條件是長條內容有移動。步驟 6 通過的條件是其後外層視圖仍有反應——它所要防範的失敗
# 是「內層視圖捲到盡頭後一切都凍結」，因此結尾的垂直捲動正是該項檢查，而非附加動作。
#
# expect: log-contains outer moved after the strip reached its end
#
# Step 6 as a check (2026-11-17): P8 logs that line when the outer view's
# offset changes after the strip reached H13. On Xvfb the strip reached H13
# and the outer view stayed at row 0, yet the row passed (CI run 43983878134).
# 第 6 步改為檢查(2026-11-17):長條到達 H13 之後外層位移若改變,P8 會記下這一行。Xvfb 上長條到了 H13,外層卻停在第 0 列，
# 那一列仍然通過(CI run 43983878134)。
#
# 2026-11-15: the pointer is put on the strip with `taplabel H4` instead of
# `move,320,453`. That point had drifted below the strip into the "Outer row"
# area, so the sideways scroll went to the outer view and the strip never
# moved -- while the sweep still counted the row as a pass. xdotool's
# horizontal wheel itself works: button 7 scrolled a plain GTK4
# ScrolledWindow from 0 to 543 in the same session.
# 2026-11-15:改以 `taplabel H4` 把指標放到長條上，取代 `move,320,453`。那一點已偏到長條下方的「Outer row」區域，橫向捲動
# 送到了外層視圖，長條從沒動過——sweep 卻仍算這列通過。xdotool 的水平滾輪本身沒問題：同一個 session 中按鈕 7 讓一個純 GTK4
# ScrolledWindow 從 0 捲到 543。
taplabel,,,,,H4,,over the horizontal strip -- a tap on its H4 label leaves the pointer there,gtk
sleep,,,,,,400000,,gtk
scroll,10,0,,,,,ten notches right -- past the strip's end,gtk
sleep,,,,,,800000,,gtk
scroll,4,0,,,,,keep going with nowhere left to go,gtk
sleep,,,,,,800000,,gtk
scroll,0,3,,,,,now vertically -- the outer view must still move,gtk
sleep,,,,,,1200000,hold for the screenshot,gtk
